WEBVTT

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:10.480
<i>Do you think spirits and Shinigamis 
don't concern you at all?</i>

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.490
<i>Oh, but they do.</i>

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>For example, say you're casually 
playing at a playground...</i>

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.130
<i>Look away for one second,</i>

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:27.380
<i>and a Damashigami might take someone away.</i>

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:31.350
<i>A Damashigami is a heinous Shinigami that</i>

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:35.380
<i>takes the living illegally, before their time.</i>

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.270
Damashigami.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.680
Prepare yourself!

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:45.410
You're not getting away!

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:55.700
Coin throw!

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.580
This duck must be one of them.

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:09.150
I'll take you both down!

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.100
Serves you right.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:31.730
My plan is ruined, thanks to you.

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:33.380
What?

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:34.490
Who are you?

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:39.010
I'm Kain the Shirushigami.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:14.500
Kain the Shirushigami

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:16.290
Think about it.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:18.570
What good is it catching one bunny?

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:21.130
To Damashigami Company

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:25.470
The path to the evil organization 
Damashigami Company changes every time.

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:32.200
I wanted to let that bunny go,

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:37.100
and follow him to the Company 
to smoke them all out at once.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.780
But you got in my way.

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:41.900
Are <i>you</i> with the Damashigami?

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.020
No!

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:45.040
I despise the Company.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.160
I'm Shinigami Ageha.

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:47.750
Ageha?

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:49.660
Oh, her.

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:52.390
You're the incompetent daughter 
of the embarrassing family,

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:58.680
whose older sister got fooled by a man 
into working for the Damashigami Company.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.300
The older one was an idiot.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.550
The younger one must have 
the brains of a bug, too.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:16.560
All right, open your textbooks to page 39.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:18.380
This is going to be on the test.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:22.220
It's not fair!

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.140
Ageha.

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:26.570
<i>Ageha the Shinigami is 
invisible to ordinary people.</i>

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:29.440
He made fun of me!

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.670
It's not fair!

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:31.520
It's not fair!

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:33.390
It's not fair!

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:39.010
<i>But to those who can see 
her, she's annoying as </i>hell<i>.</i>

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.900
Boo hoo.

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:47.910
Boo hoo.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:47.080
So he held nothing back, huh?

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:49.570
It's not fair!

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:50.440
It's not fair!

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.970
It's not fair!

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:55.890
So that boy's chasing the 
Damashigami, too, then.

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:57.480
So is he a Shinigami?

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:58.640
Boo.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.470
He said Shirushigami.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:08.510
<i>Whereas Rinne and Ageha work in 
the field guiding the deceased,</i>

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:15.250
<i>a Shirushigami is a bookkeeper who makes 
sure people have lived out their given time.</i>

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.130
Oh, yeah. He said...

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:26.420
I can't overlook a Damashigami's illegal activities, 
especially as a Shirushigami.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:29.140
Never get in my way again.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:30.890
That is all, dumb girl.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:35.600
I swear, I'll take Damashigami 
Company down before you do!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.730
I have strong connections!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.880
Why would you of all people have connections?

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:42.940
What a sad lie.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.160
I'm not lying!

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:47.530
The Company President's son is on my side!

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.680
The President's son?

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:52.490
Are you talking about Rokudou Rinne?

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.230
He knew about Rinne.

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:57.340
Say what?

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:05.760
It's scorched.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.250
What on earth?

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.790
That's that Kain guy I was talking about!

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:27.900
Lifespan
Records

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:24.180
Rokudou Rinne.

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:27.900
You have a debt so large you couldn't 
possibly pay it back in your lifetime.

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:33.590
Why did he look up his debts when he's only 
supposed to be in charge of lifespans?

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:36.270
Hey, you! What's your problem?

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.410
Are you trying to kill Rinne?

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.350
My point is that you have 
no chance to pay it off

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.610
making chump change in the living world.

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:47.320
But convert it to lifespan, 
and you can pay it all off!

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:50.510
So he <i>is</i> trying to kill him.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:56.580
That doesn't seem like something 
a Shirushigami would do.

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:58.360
Who are you?

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:00.390
Can't you tell?

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.250
I'm Kain the Shirushigami.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:06.280
You could say I'm your creditor.

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:10.160
Creditor?

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:11.740
So he's a debt collector.

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:12.660
What's going on?

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:16.410
Rokudou Rinne, we've met before.

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:18.420
When we were kids.

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:20.160
Sorry, I don't remember.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:24.070
Rokudou-kun owes that Kain person money?

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:28.600
He's being pretty extreme 
for a kid's debt, though.

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:33.850
My divorced mother raised me by herself.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:36.470
One day, my mother...

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:42.640
Don't you want a new dad, Kain?

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:43.980
Let's go see him.

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.970
Heya, kept you waiting.

00:07:56.720 --> 00:08:03.540
Even as a kid, I could tell that the 
red-haired man who met us at the café was shady.

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:06.170
<i>Dad.</i>

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:11.120
Sabato-san, here's your money.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:12.680
Thank you!

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:14.180
I'll repay you double.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:20.730
Here's my collateral.

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:23.290
I grabbed a ton of stuff from home.

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:24.560
Oh, my.

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:29.020
We're getting married anyway. 
You didn't need to bring collateral.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:31.800
What an honest man you are.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.250
Wait, Dad!

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:39.450
You took the precious thing 
Grandma gave me, didn't you!

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:41.070
"Dad"?

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:43.180
I thought you were single, Sabato-san.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.880
Oh shoot, I gotta go!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.290
Let's go, Rinne!

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:53.970
Sabato-san?

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:57.720
All that was left were loan agreements 
and the so-called collateral:

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.320
a pile of junk.

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:04.730
Go, Shinigami Dai-ichi High School
 Get into Shinigami Dai-ichi High School

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:14.240
Shinigami Dai-ichi High School

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:10.360
When I was in middle school,

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:14.230
I had to give up on going to high 
school because I was so poor.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:20.620
Gee, you should at least turn on the lights.

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:28.650
My, I'm sorry. I guess 
they stopped our power.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:34.840
I decided that instead 
of going to high school,

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.960
I would get a job at the 
Mortal Census Bureau.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:47.100
Thanks to you and your father, 
I couldn't even get into high school.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:48.730
Wait a second.

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:52.690
I don't know what his dad did, 
but Rinne didn't do anything wrong.

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:56.700
Loan Agreement
 50,000 yen

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:58.930
On the contrary; his son, 
Rinne, is a cosigner.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:03.910
And I'm going to enforce 
the contract by force!

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:08.250
My scythe!

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:13.880
Rokudou-kun!

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.750
Rokudou-kun!

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:25.770
Rokudou!

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.410
Your Haori of the Underworld 
will sell for a good amount.

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:30.770
I'm seizing it.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:32.770
Seized

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:36.540
Rokudou-kun!

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:37.610
Rinne!

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.630
He's not breathing.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:48.470
I'm taking Rinne's lifespan, 
his Life Flame, as collateral.

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:50.600
His Life Flame?

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:52.420
Give it back!

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.130
Don't be so rash.

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:02.970
Do you not care what 
happens to his Life Flame?

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:09.850
If you want it back, go 
find Damashigami Company.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:13.240
Find it by tomorrow morning at ten.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:14.690
Ten in the morning?!

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:18.730
That's when the Afterlife 
recycle shop opens.

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:23.130
And that's when I'll sell the Haori of 
the Underworld along with his Life Flame.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:29.340
Rokudou Rinne's life will expire the 
moment the shop takes ownership.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:33.640
Ageha.

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:34.790
<i>So rude!</i>

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:37.060
You're our only hope.

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:38.950
Where is Damashigami Company?

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:42.300
Again, I'd already be there if I knew.

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:45.180
You useless woman.

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:46.770
Say what?!

00:11:46.770 --> 00:11:48.680
You B-grade exorcist!

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.920
Shut up, you incompetent Shinigami!

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:54.190
We won't make it if we 
start looking for him now.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:58.660
Rinne-sama, I got some bread crusts!

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:00.030
Rokumon-chan.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.760
Rinne-sama.

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:06.900
He's cold.

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:16.670
I— I won't tell anyone.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:21.910
I won't tell anyone you did it!

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:26.190
Why the heck would we 
bother to murder Rokudou?

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:27.930
Tsubasa-kun, catch him!

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.680
Holy Ash!

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:36.500
Rokumon-chan, please, 
take me to the afterworld.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:38.610
To where the Shirushigami is.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:42.320
Are you going to go take back 
his Life Flame directly?

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:47.140
And then what?

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:49.960
He's not just going to hand it over.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:52.200
We have to do something, or Rokudou-kun's...

00:12:52.590 --> 00:12:54.370
Rokudou-kun.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.130
His spirit?

00:12:57.130 --> 00:13:00.710
I got plucked out when he took my Life Flame.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:05.340
In any case, you humans can't get 
involved in what's about to happen next.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:07.170
Rokudou-kun.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.980
<i>I need to take back my Life 
Flame with my own hands.</i>

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.060
I'm coming with you even if you refuse.

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:20.240
Ageha.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.180
I don't like Kain's way of doing things.

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:24.570
Taking life as collateral for a loan...

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.660
That's the same as what the Damashigami do.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:27.800
Me, too.

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:29.530
I can't just wait quietly.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.440
I'll help.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:34.380
We're better off with 
all the help we can get.

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:37.500
Don't get the wrong idea. I'm just 
here as Mamiya-san's bodyguard.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:46.260
<i>I appreciate it, but I was hoping someone 
would stay back and keep an eye on my body.</i>

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:54.270
<i>Meanwhile, Rokudou Rinne's body 
had seen better days.</i>

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:06.030
Mortal Census Bureau?

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:07.110
Yeah.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:10.020
It's the department that manages 
human lifespan records.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:11.660
It's where the Shirushigami work.

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:14.200
So Kain is here?

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.020
Probably.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:15.800
Maybe.

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:16.410
I hope.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:18.290
Could you be any more unreliable?

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:21.670
Huh?

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:23.910
Where's Rokudou-kun (spirit)?

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.640
He's going to the Rinne no Wa!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.790
Rinne-sama!

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:40.190
Don't go over there!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.650
It was so powerful.

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:50.570
You'd be forced to be reborn if you 
touched the Rinne no Wa as a spirit.

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.120
What are you doing here?

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:56.700
Especially you two, you 
don't seem to be dead yet.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.680
Shoot, we should run!

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:04.760
Swoosh!

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:09.820
We have living humans!

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:12.630
Catch them and send them 
back to the living world!

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:13.300
Sir!

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:15.070
That way! Get them!

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:16.930
Don't lose them! Hurry!

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:20.060
So you've come to take it back.

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:26.940
<i>Which means they really don't know 
where Damashigami Company is.</i>

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:29.590
What a useless bunch.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:34.600
Where'd they go?

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:35.860
They're not here.

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:36.830
You go that way.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:37.930
Got it.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:44.330
Thank goodness.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.050
Dude, Ageha, why are we running?

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:48.460
Shut up!

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:50.910
We wouldn't have been caught 
if it weren't for you two.

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:53.720
Huh? Where's Rokudou-kun?

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:59.620
Rinne-sama!

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:07.070
What's the matter?

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:10.570
Oh, you're a sight for sore eyes.

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:13.450
Who's that?

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:21.050
My, that's serious.

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:24.650
Being hunted by your lender.

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:26.330
Poor you.

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:30.380
I don't know who you are, but 
thank you for your kindness.

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:33.160
No, it's all right.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.150
But what do I do?

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:37.550
I'm so sheltered.

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:42.680
I don't know of any recycle shops 
that such things might have ended up at.

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:46.860
Of course, you live in such a classy mansion.

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:50.650
<i>But it's kind of dark here.</i>

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:54.910
Oh, no!

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:01.940
I'm sorry.

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:03.430
It's so dark.

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:04.080
It's fine.

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:06.420
Let's turn on the lights.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.800
Actually, we don't have power.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:11.600
You're poor?

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:16.760
Oh, I know, I have an idea.

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:22.810
<i>That can't be...</i>

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.560
<i>The Haori of the Underworld.</i>

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:32.090
See? It's so bright.

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:33.960
My Life Flame!

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:40.950
You. What are you lot doing here?

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:43.960
Oh, welcome home, Kain.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.250
This is your place?!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:48.830
Sushi

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:46.660
Hello!

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:48.200
Higan Sushi!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:52.280
Prime quality nigiri sushi for five!

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:54.250
Put it on my tab, please.

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:56.900
Eat up.

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:58.960
It looks so good.

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:01.770
Are you sure? You don't even have power.

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:03.970
Eat lots.

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:05.810
If you insist.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.400
So that woman...

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.480
Got conned by Rokudou-kun's dad.

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:12.840
Yeah.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:14.600
And he took our money.

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:15.700
That's my mom.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:18.240
Oh, that's not true, Kain.

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:22.740
Sabato-san sends me love letters every month.

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:29.360
<i>I'll come back for you once I make big 
money on my new project. I promise.</i>

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:33.930
<i>By the way, I need some money really 
quick. Could you send me some, please?</i>

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:35.000
<i>Sabato</i>

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:43.280
<i>I'm here in Hawaii to do 
research for my business.</i>

00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:45.620
<i>I ran out of money for my plane home!</i>

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:47.650
<i>Send me just a little bit!</i>

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:48.600
<i>I love you.</i>

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:49.770
<i>Sabato</i>

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:55.390
<i>Money, please.</i>

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:56.350
<i>Love ya. <3</i>

00:18:56.350 --> 00:18:57.150
<i>Sabato</i>

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:04.030
He sends me one every month, 
even though he's so busy with work.

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:09.880
<i>He seriously ticks me off!</i>

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:13.060
<i>Is it possible that she's 
still getting conned?</i>

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:15.300
<i>It mite be!</i>

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:22.870
Kain, does your mother know about this?

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:24.470
That your mother is a Damashi—

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:30.350
Don't say it

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:28.570
<i>It's a secret?</i>

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:35.480
I realized from having read a lot of 
documents as a Shirushigami

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:42.740
that right after he stole money from my mother, 
Damashigami Company was established.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:46.740
In other words, your mother's 
money was the company's capital.

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:51.660
I don't want my mother to find 
out that her money was misused.

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:53.250
To imagine how hurt she'd be...

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.360
Why are you eating the sushi?

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:59.780
And when did you take back your 
Haori of the Underworld?

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:05.380
<i>Rokudou Rinne may be a spirit, and he 
may have had his Life Flame stolen,</i>

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.640
<i>but by wearing his Haori of 
the Underworld inside out,</i>

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:10.890
<i>he can materialize to eat sushi.</i>

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:12.680
Umm...

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:17.170
I found a loan agreement attached 
to one of the love letters to your Mom.

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:23.660
Rokudou-kun's written down as a 
cosigner, but this seal is forged.

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:23.660
Cosigner
 Rokudou Rinne

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:25.370
<i>I can't stress this enough:</i>

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:29.470
<i>Never, ever be a cosigner to 
someone you don't trust. Ever.</i>

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:32.420
<i>And never, ever </i>ever<i> forge seals!</i>

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:33.670
<i>Don't do it!</i>

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:37.530
So Rokudou-kun's a victim of his father, too.

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:39.240
It's no use, Mamiya Sakura.

00:20:40.190 --> 00:20:42.330
Yeah, I don't want to hear it.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.040
Guys!

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:45.680
I put them to sleep.

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.430
Rokudou Rinne.

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:51.750
Blame your own vile father!

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:52.850
Rokudou-kun!

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:56.270
Come.

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:09.540
Stay put here.

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:12.810
Hey!

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:14.490
Don't worry.

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:16.500
A Shirushigami is still a Shinigami.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:19.940
I won't hurt the living.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:26.530
But as a human-Shinigami kind of thing, 
I won't go easy on Rokudou Rinne.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:29.010
What are you going to do to Rokudou-kun?

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:33.030
Wait!

00:21:33.030 --> 00:21:35.470
You can't take his life just 
because you resent him.

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:36.980
Please, don't!

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:38.130
Wait!

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:39.060
Open up!

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:47.630
Am I inside a shed?

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:58.830
To Rinne
Read this out loud

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:58.320
"To Rinne
Read this out loud"

00:21:59.860 --> 00:22:02.590
Is this Rokudou-kun's...

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:08.060
It's sucking me in.

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:14.470
Even materialized, you're just 
a husk without your Life Flame.

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:16.250
Kain!

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:19.850
It seems you can't resist the 
power of the Rinne no Wa.

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:24.480
I'll force you into the Rinne 
no Wa and make you be reborn.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode:
In the Box

00:24:03.220 --> 00:24:06.460
The box... Fill the box...

00:24:06.460 --> 00:24:07.900
What's wrong, Rokumon-chan?

00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:11.640
The box... Fill the box...

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:13.240
He's talking in his sleep.

00:24:13.240 --> 00:24:17.370
We have to fill the box with roses,

00:24:17.370 --> 00:24:21.980
or we won't have enough money to make 
it through the month, Rinne-sama.

00:24:22.220 --> 00:24:25.980
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>:
"In the Box."
